// libqmi_force_ipcr (the socket()-interposing force-ipcr shim) moved to
// device/xiaomi/mithorium-common/libshim/ — the family-wide gnss service
// links it and soong namespaces only import downward (mithorium-common
// cannot see modules defined here). It rides as DT_NEEDED of its consumers,
// never LD_PRELOAD (bionic scrubs LD_PRELOAD under Enforcing: neverallow
// init *:process noatsecure, b/140789528). See PLAN-qmux-bridge.md.
